sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant AuthZ as Authorization Guard
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant Resource as Target Resource Resolver
    participant Scope as ScopeEvaluator
    participant Handler as Business Handler

    AuthZ->>Redis: Load user Role + Scope entries
    Redis-->>AuthZ: Effective access

    AuthZ->>Resource: Resolve target attributes
    Resource-->>AuthZ: company/location/department/manager/owner

    loop Every grant containing required Permission
        AuthZ->>Scope: covers(scope, target)?
        Scope-->>AuthZ: true / false
    end

    alt At least one Scope covers target
        AuthZ->>Handler: Allow
    else No applicable Scope
        AuthZ-->>User: 403 Forbidden
    end
